Anka Serisi, yeniden başlamaktan çok, geçmişin izlerini taşıyarak başka bir varoluşa dönüşmenin hikâyesidir.', 'Interpreting the mythological being of the Anka through an abstract bird form, this work focuses on the moment of ascent that follows rebirth, with its long, upward-reaching body. The contrast between the broad surface evoking a wing and the slender, curving neck gives the form a sense of both stillness and movement. The green and shimmering tones emerging on the dark metallic surface evoke the Anka passing through fire and becoming another existence. Anka II symbolises regaining strength after transformation and life rising out of darkness.

