In this series, therefore, rebirth does not mean the complete erasure of the past. With each transformation the Anka carries traces of its previous existence. It breaks, changes, takes shape again and rises.

Rather than a fresh start, the Anka Series is the story of becoming another existence while carrying the traces of the past.', 'Seramik Heykeller', 'Masalın Hafızası — Anka Serisi', 'Seramik heykel, elde şekillendirme, sırlı yüzey', 'Ceramic sculpture, hand-built, glazed surface', '26 × 50 cm', '26 × 50 cm', NULL, NULL, (select id from artists where slug='melike'), 301, false) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

