Anka Serisi, yeniden başlamaktan çok, geçmişin izlerini taşıyarak başka bir varoluşa dönüşmenin hikâyesidir.', 'Continuing the Anka’s cycle of rebirth, this work evokes life regaining movement through its rising body and layered wings opening outwards. The blending of earth, amber and burnt-brown tones on the surface symbolises the being that has passed through fire becoming one with nature again. Curving forms reaching out from the body in different directions express opening up, growing stronger and turning towards a new life after transformation. Anka III represents the reborn being’s return to the world and the continuity of life.

