Anka Serisi, yeniden başlamaktan çok, geçmişin izlerini taşıyarak başka bir varoluşa dönüşmenin hikâyesidir.', 'In this work, where the Anka’s cycle of rebirth is completed, the rising body and the wing and tail pieces opening in different directions bring a sense of liberation and movement to the fore. Pointed forms multiplying out from the body evoke the release of an inner energy and a regained vitality. While the earthy, dark surface preserves the traces the Anka carries from fire and transformation, the upward-turned head and opening wings point to a new beginning. Anka IV symbolises the liberation of a being that has completed its transformation and its ascent back into life.

