Anka Serisi, yeniden başlamaktan çok, geçmişin izlerini taşıyarak başka bir varoluşa dönüşmenin hikâyesidir.', 'Representing a new beginning in the Anka’s journey of transformation, this work stands apart from the earlier pieces in the series with its light-coloured surface and wings rising in layers. The cracks and surface marks on the body carry the idea that the past is not erased but lives on in the memory of the reborn being. The upward-reaching neck and the wings that open and multiply strengthen the feeling of lightness, liberation and ascent that follows rebirth. Anka V symbolises a life that begins again while carrying the traces of the past.

